Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Scope (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value HOLDTIME (\d+)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S*)

Start
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${Scope}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${Scope}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
